---
// src/pages/application-received.astro
// Netlify redirects here after a successful /apply submission.
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Application Received | Location Freedom</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root { --ivory: #FAF6F0; --indigo: #252039; --purple: #76618F; --body: #51485A; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; background: var(--ivory); color: var(--body); font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
    h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; color: var(--indigo); font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .wrap { max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; text-align: center; }
    a { color: var(--purple); }
    .back { display: inline-block; margin-top: 32px; color: var(--indigo); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <h1>Thank you for applying.</h1>
    <p>
      I read every application myself. You'll hear back from me personally — there's
      no automated acceptance or rejection here, so please give it a little time.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you're approved, I'll follow up with next steps and a private checkout link.
      If it's not the right fit right now, I'll tell you honestly and, where I can,
      point you toward something that might help instead.
    </p>
    <a class="back" href="/">← Back to Location Freedom</a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
